  "id": "infra-namedwindow-consumer",
  "description": "InfraNamedWindowConsumer named-window consumer semantics: keepall irstream select, length-window aggregate consumer, and an expr_batch insert-into chain (ords 0-2). listener records capture the irstream select's per-insert new rows and the aggregate consumer's per-update new/old pairs (Java source regression-lib/src/main/java/com/espertech/esper/regressionlib/suite/infra/namedwindow/InfraNamedWindowConsumer.java).",
  "javaCommit": "9e1b9f1cc9117fea4bf33ab043762c045d73839c",
